  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sangley Point International Airport Forecast Feasibility Study, through The SAP Group LLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant funds a feasibility study for Cavitex Holdings, the Lead Developer/Equity Investor in the Sangley Point International Airport Development Consortium. This feasibility study will develop the optimal strategic development plan for the new Sangley Point International Airport in Metro Manila, Philippines by preparing aviation activity forecasts, assessing prior planning studies, and performing financial feasibility assessments, among other tasks. The new airport will increase airport capacity in Metro Manila.</narrative>
  </description>
